# Permissive fallback policy.
#
# Attached to every program that does not match a named PROGRAM-POLICY.
# Inherits the unrestricted class so the fallback is named and
# reviewable. Tighten by replacing INHERIT with a more restrictive class
# (e.g. compute-only) once per-program policies cover the apps you care
# about.

DEFAULT { INHERIT unrestricted }
